name=Test Ground (dev tool)
id=TestGround
description=Dev tool for measuring and checking patches. Runs a fixed test plan (Zomboid/Lua/TestGround_plan.txt) in a singleplayer save: sets the scene (start spot, time, weather, zombies), then walks a route, sweeps a road at driving speed, idles, turns, waits through in-game time and runs Walk To cases, writing frame times, Lua Event Profiler costs per step and a behaviour log to Zomboid/Lua/. Right-click > Test Ground to run or to record spots. Changes the save it runs in, so use a copy.
modversion=1.13.22
versionMin=42.0.0
